(environment-extension)
*sixdof
*atmos rcc ktf-annual
*earth wgs-84
*method rk4-fixed variable-mass
*wind geodetic file=environment_wind.dat units=ft/sec

*trajectory 1 wind_vehicle start on 1
  *initial geodetic time=0 wt=1000 alt=100 lat=0 long=0 vel=100 gama=0 psi=90
  *segment 1 wind-flight
    *when time>1 stop
*end
